    "short_description": "Kiopioke is a vibrant platformer about a resilient bird with a broken wing. Master the &quot;beak-technique&quot; of poking your beak into walls and then launch yourself through over 250 challenging levels. Meet a colourful cast of friends and foes and seek out secret items in this delightful adventure!",
